# Implementation Plan — Embedding Generation, Vector Storage, and Ingestion Orchestration

This implementation plan details the architecture and components required to build the production-grade embedding generation, vector storage, and corpus ingestion orchestration layer for MediSense in `com.medisense.rag.embedding` and `com.medisense.ingestion`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Google Multilingual Embedding (768-dim)**: Supports `text-multilingual-embedding-002` for both English ingestion chunks and Tamil/Tanglish queries.
> - **Circuit Breaker & Fallback**: Switches to `FallbackEmbeddingClient` after 5 consecutive API failures.
> - **Redis Query Caching**: Caches query embeddings with key `SHA256(normalized_query_text)` and TTL 24 hours.
> - **PostgreSQL pgvector Vector(768) Mapping**: Configures `ChildChunkEntity` to map directly to `pgvector`'s `vector(768)` column type.
> - **Corpus Ingestion Orchestration**: Handles end-to-end pipeline execution (parse → clean → structure → chunk → embed → store), idempotency checksum verification, and `ingestion_jobs` progress tracking.

