### Component 4: Corpus Ingestion Orchestration

#### [NEW] [CorpusIngestionOrchestrator.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/ingestion/CorpusIngestionOrchestrator.java)
- Coordinates full pipeline: Parse → Clean → Structure → Chunk → Embed → Store.
- Idempotency check: SHA256 checksum check on file content to skip existing documents.
- Transactional rollback: `@Transactional` rollback if embedding or storage fails.
- Progress tracking: updates `ingestion_jobs` status (`PENDING`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `COMPLETED`, `FAILED`) and percentage ($0\% \rightarrow 25\% \rightarrow 50\% \rightarrow 75\% \rightarrow 100\%$).
- Marks child chunks `is_active=TRUE` on completion.

